



>> CoffeeGrounds := វត្ថុ ថ្មី.
CoffeeGrounds ពេលទទួល: ['extract'] ធ្វើ: { <- ['coffee']. }.

>> CoffeeMachine := វត្ថុ ថ្មី.
CoffeeMachine ពេលទទួល: ['init'] ធ្វើ: {
	ផ្ទាល់ coffeegrounds := CoffeeGrounds ថ្មី.
}.
CoffeeMachine ពេលទទួល: ['ថ្មី'] ធ្វើ: { <- CoffeeMachine `new init.
}.

CoffeeMachine ពេលទទួល: ['makeTea'] ធ្វើ: { <- (ផ្ទាល់ tealeaves extract). }.
CoffeeMachine ពេលទទួល: ['makeCoffee'] ធ្វើ: { <- (ផ្ទាល់ coffeegrounds extract). }.

>> coffeeDream := CoffeeMachine ថ្មី.

លទ្ធផល សរសេរ:
	coffeeDream 
	makeCoffee.

លទ្ធផល សរសេរ:
	coffeeDream 
	makeTea.
